 love david fincher but i'm  judging him like any other show  and he still to me did great i love this  show it made me think the whole time  it's right up my alley  people who love psychological type  thriller  a lot of thinking and a very smart show  this is it  there's no way you can play with the  characters here the acting across the  board was great the writing was solid  and i i cannot wait  for more i usually don't binge shows  this one i binged  that's how much i loved it i'm gonna  give this season a nine  super great for an opening season and it  seems like a show if you're putting  stock in it's just gonna get better and  better and i feel like second season  people are kind of in the middle about  season one which i've seen a lot i feel  like the second season is just gonna be  different level so i cannot wait again  please comment below what you thought of  the season  as a whole did you like it what would  you give it as a rating one to ten  and who would you relate to the most of  these characters i really want to know  let me know down below who you agreed  with whose side you're on  i can't wait to hear your thoughts i  respond to everyone please subscribe i  do  tons of tv shows movie reviews celebrity  interviews  you name it and please follow me at  stevevarley1 on twitter and instagram  and keep coming back
 

